# Practical 800K edition. XL keeps every overlay, including new additions.
# Explicit allowlist: adding a specialized viewer must not silently fill
# the floppy again. Keep file management, recovery, image tools, archives,
# BASIC/assembly readers and the common document, picture and music readers.
# Native overlays include routing helpers and are all retained.
PLUGINS800 = $(PLUGINS)
XPLUGINS800 = applewr awdata blkedit blkview bootblk cpm cpmw crc date dgrview disasm diskcmp dos33w dosbas dosfont dosimage dosint dosmcs dosput dosrepl dosview doswrite duet favrun find fixit fixtypes fontrix fontview goto ident idformats idread idv1 imgconv imgput intbasic macpaint mcs mcsimport mcsplay mdview mkimage move movecopy music nibcopy pascal pascalw pastext pfsfile pfsplan printshop psborder psfont pt3 rename repair rescue sciibin shapes smalldos sync tagpat tree txtconv undelete unsq unwrap verify visicalc volinfo volname wipe
